## Project layout

- `src/{{ package_import_name }}/` — the package. `cli.py` defines the `{{ cli_command_name }}`
  command entry point.
- `tests/` — pytest test suite, mirrors the package layout.
{% if include_mypy %}
- Type-checked with `mypy` (`uv run mypy src`).
{% endif %}

## Running things

- `uv run {{ cli_command_name }}` — run the CLI.
- `uv run pytest` — run the test suite.
- `uv run ruff check .` / `uv run ruff format .` — lint / format.
{% if database != 'none' %}

## Database

- `DATABASE_URL` in `.env` (copy it from `.env.example`) is the connection string.
{% if db_is_server %}
- The `{{ database }}` server lives in `docker-compose.yml`; start it from inside the
  devcontainer with `docker compose up -d` (it publishes on `127.0.0.1:{{ db_port }}`). The
  `{% if database == 'postgres' %}psycopg{% else %}mysqlclient{% endif %}` driver is in `pyproject.toml`; add your own client or ORM on top.
{% else %}
- A local SQLite file (`db.sqlite3`); there is no service to start.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
